Laya Fast is an independent Apple Silicon runtime for the Laya decision model.
It is not an official Convai Innovations or Apple release.

Convai Innovations created Laya. This repository's MLX model and request API
port/adapt the Apache-2.0 Laya inference implementation:
https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
Copyright Convai Innovations and Laya contributors.
